Modifications by Free Auto CarPlay
----------------------------------

- 32-bit (armeabi-v7a) builds for Android 4.0–9 car head units.
- External USB Bluetooth receiver support, in addition to the head unit's
  built-in Bluetooth and wired connections.
- In-app OTA updates and a hot-update shell that preserves settings,
  pairing and first-run wizard progress.
- First-run wizard, connection-route handling, steering-wheel key learning,
  single-file log export and crash logging.
- Chinese UI and documentation.

